# REMEMBERDSTATE — Manyika Ranch UI direction

When the user types **`REMEMBERDSTATE`**, **`REMEMBEREDSTATE`**, or **“remembered state”**, restore this context and continue from it (do not invent a different IA).

## Reference product (inspire, do not clone)

- App: **Cattlytics** — https://cattlytics.folio3.com/
- Channel: https://www.youtube.com/@Cattlytics
- Sample video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x2QCp3CQddE
- Screenshots from review session live under the Cursor project assets folder (filenames like `Screenshot_2026-08-03_at_*.png`).

**Take from Cattlytics:** activity card hub, category pills, location/cattle card chrome, report grids, clear primary CTAs, fewer top-level nav items, classic ranch day-to-day flow.

**Do not clone:** Cattlytics green brand, Ask AI FAB, Groups product, Scheduler/Planner as Phase A scope, US-only lifecycle IA as primary navigation.

## Locked product decisions

- **1C**: Phase A first (shell + Activities hub + light entry chrome); **Phase B** = animals form pills, reports card gallery, inventory cards, finance hub consolidation, lifecycle labels from sex/age.
- **2A**: Keep **Manyika Ranch** brand (name + existing palette in `globals.css`). Borrow structure/flow only.

## Phase B shipped surfaces

- Register animal: choice pills for sex/source; clearer header CTAs  
- Reports: typed card gallery (Herd / Health / Sales / Finance)  
- Medicine inventory: card grid + add section  
- Finance: activity-style hub including Buyers + Sales links  
- Animals list: lifecycle badges (calf/heifer/cow/bull/steer) via `src/lib/lifecycle.ts`  

## Target primary sidebar

1. Dashboard  
2. Animals  
3. Camps  
4. Activities (hub)  
5. Reports  
6. Finance  
7. Alerts  
8. Settings (nested: users, breeds, ranch, activity log)

Deep routes (`/breeding`, `/sales`, `/health`, etc.) stay valid; they are reached from Activities cards, not as long sidebar lists.

## Activities hub categories

All / Health / Breeding / Movement / Sales & records — cards gate by existing RBAC permissions.
